# What must never reach the image.
#
# The first two are correctness — a host's node_modules copied into a Linux
# image is how you ship the wrong binaries. The rest are secrecy: the real
# Content Directory is a hundred and fifty colleagues and their addresses,
# and a local database may hold anything the team has written.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist

.env
.env.*
data/directory.json
data/*.db
data/*.db-shm
data/*.db-wal

.git
.github
.claude
demo/forecasters-hub.html
*.log
*.tsbuildinfo
